          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What certifications and standards support your services?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS uses documented chain of custody practices and data sanitization methods aligned with NIST SP 800-88 guidance. Project documentation can support Bakersfield organizations managing HIPAA, FERPA, GLBA, FISMA, and internal information-security requirements. Each organization remains responsible for determining its own regulatory obligations and records requirements."
