          "name": "What standards guide electronic recycling services in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS uses documented processes that can reference NIST 800-88, California's Electronic Waste Recycling Act, SB 20 and SB 50, DTSC guidance, and CalRecycle requirements. The appropriate records depend on equipment type, requested disposition, and the organization's documentation needs."
