        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What areas around Bakersfield does STS serve?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS serves businesses and institutions throughout Bakersfield, Kern County, and the surrounding San Joaquin Valley. Pickup planning can include Downtown Bakersfield, Southwest Bakersfield, Rosedale, Oildale, and commercial corridors connected to I-5 and CA-99, subject to volume and access details."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does electronic recycling pickup take in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Many Bakersfield projects can be scheduled within the same week after volume, equipment type, access, and pickup requirements are confirmed. Larger or multi-site projects may require additional coordination before a final schedule is selected."
