            "text": "Yes. STS can discuss equipment inventories, serialized asset tracking, pickup coordination, data-bearing devices, recovery review, and downstream reporting for commercial, educational, healthcare, and public-sector refresh projects in Bakersfield and Kern County."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What electronics can businesses recycle in Bakersfield?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Bakersfield businesses can discuss recycling for computers, laptops, cell phones, networking equipment, printers, copiers, servers, monitors, ink and toner, and other retired electronic equipment. Pickup planning can address mixed loads and equipment refreshes."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is data-bearing equipment handled during electronic recycling?",
