            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Data-bearing equipment should be identified before pickup so the requested sanitization or destruction method can be documented. STS can discuss secure wiping, physical destruction, serialized asset records, chain-of-custody documentation, and Certificates of Destruction during project planning."
